{
  "name": "catfish",
  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/fish/catfish.py): a wels catfish, 2.2 m -- a HUGE BROAD FLAT HEAD with a wide mouth gaping across its front (the lower jaw a little past the upper), tiny eyes set far forward, TWO VERY LONG WHISKERS sweeping out and back from the corners of the upper jaw and four short ones under the chin (`horn`s); a scaleless body, round in front and squeezed flat toward the tail; a TINY dorsal fin, a VERY LONG ANAL FIN from mid-body almost to the small rounded tail, pectorals and small pelvics; dark olive-black above, MARBLED sides, a pale mottled belly (the coat pattern `mottle`). Each fin is one membrane sheet. A slow SWIMMER near the bottom (the fish's plumbing).",
